    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In the 1840s, Henderson donated land and money for Baptist and Methodist churches, now marked by historic brick buildings.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.hendersontx.us/324/About-Henderson"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Howard Dickinson House, built in 1855, is a Texas Historic Landmark and one of the oldest brick homes in Henderson.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
