      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.hendersontx.us/324/About-Henderson"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1874, the Henderson and Overton Branch Railroad linked the town to Overton, later sold to Missouri‑Pacific and still in use today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
